{"3867520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frozen Feathers", "steam_appid": 3867520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Frozen Feathers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for an epic, frosty showdown in <strong>Frozen Feathers</strong> – a multiplayer online game where you throw snowballs! Jump into a 3D winter wonderland where adorable penguins battle each other in PvP matches.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/9923e84b831684690d818ed29b4c2b1b.poster.avif?t=1781602575\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/9923e84b831684690d818ed29b4c2b1b.webm?t=1781602575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/9923e84b831684690d818ed29b4c2b1b.mp4?t=1781602575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect power‑ups, push opponents, slide around and above all THROW SNOWBALLS at other penguins—your friends or people from around the world. The game delivers great fun in short matches where only one champion can emerge! Watch out for built snowmen, dangerous bears, surprising traps and hazardous whirlpools! Get swept away and become the king of the PENGUINS.                            </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                                                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/7aec58dd13a7242c5dd81653d5b4906c.poster.avif?t=1781602575\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/7aec58dd13a7242c5dd81653d5b4906c.webm?t=1781602575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/7aec58dd13a7242c5dd81653d5b4906c.mp4?t=1781602575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don’t fall for enemies’ tricks! Use terrain features and powerful items to outsmart your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/453e7f76c3861ae9cf14ea710da66253.poster.avif?t=1781602575\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/453e7f76c3861ae9cf14ea710da66253.webm?t=1781602575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/453e7f76c3861ae9cf14ea710da66253.mp4?t=1781602575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Frozen Feathers is waiting for you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Frozen Feathers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for an epic, frosty showdown in <strong>Frozen Feathers</strong> – a multiplayer online game where you throw snowballs! Jump into a 3D winter wonderland where adorable penguins battle each other in PvP matches.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867520/extras/9923e84b831684690d818ed29b4c2b1b.poster.avif?t